# SMT+FVG Intermarket Divergence Scanner

This repo serves two purposes at once:

- A **research portfolio** documenting the iterative development of an ES/NQ
  intermarket-divergence (SMT) + Fair Value Gap (FVG) signal detection system.
- **Live product development** toward a profitable trading system that runs
  against a funded account.

The end goal is live profitability, so correctness and honest evaluation
matter more than impressive-looking in-sample numbers. Treat structural/logic
correctness, methodological discipline, and reproducibility as first-class
concerns — see the other rules in this directory.
